Scope. This license covers the work written for this project: the tools
(tools/), the build files (Makefile, docker/ Dockerfiles and scripts written
here, config/), the documentation (README.md, docs/, src/README.md,
ref/README.md), the formatting configuration, and every change or addition
made to src/ in this repository.

It does not cover:
- `bn`, the program by Sony Computer Entertainment that src/ reconstructs.
  No rights over that program are claimed or granted; the license applies
  only to the changes and additions made on top of it.
- ref/: third-party libraries, each under its own upstream license (see
  ref/README.md).
- docker/sonygcc/ and docker/sonybinutils/ archives and patches from the
  PlayStation 2 Linux Kit and GNU projects, under their own licenses (GPL).
- The original executable and every byte extracted from it, which never enter
  this repository.
